Everything in the `Website/` folder (the code of https://notes.arpanadhikari7.com.np)
is licensed under the MIT License. See `Website/LICENSE` for the full text.

Copyright (c) 2026 Arpan Adhikari


2. Original notes and content — CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
