similar content) is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike
4.0 International License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).

You are free to share and adapt this material for non-commercial purposes, as long as you:

  - Attribution:   give credit to "BECE Vault" with a link to
                   https://notes.arpanadhikari7.com.np (and to the author, if named),
  - NonCommercial: do not use it for commercial purposes (for example, selling it, or
                   republishing it on paid or advertising-supported websites), and
  - ShareAlike:    share any adapted material under the same license.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode
Summary:           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

The BECE Vault project itself may host, display and distribute contributed material on this
